	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l2542">Septemp[agici]</placeName> nostris sic proposuerunt: primo de pecunia Cęsaris, quam consul <placeName ref="l300">Lucernas</placeName> et <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><placeName ref="l257">Constantia</placeName> tulerit in <placeName ref="l862">Helvetios</placeName>; hoc excusarunt se fortiter ius intendentes cuivis con<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tradicenti.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Placuit excusatio, quod multorum mentes a timore et malis cogitationibus sunt <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>liberatę.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Secundo, an etiam hoc animo sunt retinendi veterum patrum nostrorum morem, quo cuivis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ius petenti ab Helvetiis ius reddant; sic enim dicuntur loquuti.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Varie hunc articulum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>interpretantur; ego expecto resolutionem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Tertio, an libeat consentire concilio etc.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ad <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>primum est responsum: si ostendant iniurię authorem, se iure cum illo acturos; ne<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>minem indicarunt preter incognitum quendam, qui ad signum Corvi sic effutierit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">R<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>eliquos articulos reservarunt communi consultationi.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Orandum est, ut dominus adesse spiritu <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>suo consultationibus dignetur in posterum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Pręter hęc multo crudelissima sunt, quę sequuntur: Constat mihi Cęsarem rogatum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>in <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> inferiore sive in <placeName ref="l808">Belgico</placeName>, ubiubi fuerit, curnam discesserit ex <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><placeName ref="l2481">Svevia</placeName> non satis firmo relicto presidio, ac respondisse levia esse, quę in <placeName ref="l808">Belgis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sit peracturus; eis expeditis mox se rediturum, unde exierit, atque <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName> su<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>periorem eo redacturum, ut caput erigere deinceps non possit; civitates etenim <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>demoliturum se, ut nullę sint muratę, colonias item ducturum, habiturum quoque <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>praesidia ubique ad quemvis motum parata perpetuaque, quibus resisti nequeat, atque <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>hoc modo ferociam domiturum <placeName ref="l822">Germanicam</placeName>, ut in posterum quietae sint nationes, quas <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>hactenus per totum ferme orbem perturbaverint <placeName ref="l822">Germani</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">His confectis eodem se modo <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>facturum cum <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiis</placeName>; tandem et <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName> se adgressurum et redacturum in pro<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>vinciam et hoc ostensurum pacto, quid sit agere bonum imperatorem.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">De hoc consilio <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>equidem dubitare non valeo; deus novit eventum.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Caveamus nos, id quod tum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>fiet, cum domino recte nos devoverimus.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Dicitur adhuc esse <placeName ref="l1284">Bruxellę</placeName> et colligere <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>pecuniam, quamobrem populum aiunt esse valde inquietum et nescio quid meditari seditionis; <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>verum interim cogitur numerare.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Subsidium <placeName ref="l832">Gallicum</placeName> e <placeName ref="l2524">Scotia</placeName> rediit in <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l830">Angli</placeName> pergunt in reformatione.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Nuptię factę <placeName ref="l509">Torgę</placeName> transactę sunt, insumpta ab <persName ref="p18509">Augusto</persName> et fratre <persName ref="p18250">Mauritio</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>circiter centena millia talerorum.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Egerunt fortiter principes de recipiendo <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Interim, verum adhuc nihil actum.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Equites ibi fuerunt 4500.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Danus promisit <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>magna.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18250">Mauritius</persName> et <persName ref="p8616">Brandenburgensis</persName> feruntur obsessuros <placeName ref="l303">Magdenburgum</placeName>; uti<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>nam his adsit dominus ut hactenus.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l749">Saxonicę</placeName> civitates languescunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l204">Hamburgum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>et <placeName ref="l2520">Suitium</placeName> stant fortiter, <placeName ref="l61">Brema</placeName> tuetur suam libertatem, retinet <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>adhuc comites <persName ref="p7652">Albertum Mansfeldensem</persName> et Oldenburgensem.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Episcopus <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensis</placeName> sub<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>inde petit exequi mandatum Cęsaris ad ipsum delatum, sed <placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName> contantur <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>expectantes <foreign xml:lang="el">απο μηχαρισ</foreign> aliquid.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Dominus et illis adsit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Miserrimus <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Cattus imperavit quidem suis, ut secundum Interim omnia instituant; at nemo <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>paret praeter <persName ref="p1903">Ioannem Leningum</persName>, <placeName ref="l319">Mulsingensem</placeName> pastorem, qui et aliis idem persuadere <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>conatur, perfidissimus apostata, qui prę aliis etiam adiutor et fautor fuit pseudo<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>gamię.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8413">Dyonisius</persName> clam aufugit.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Plerique comites et nobiles apud <lb xml:id="p1z40"/><persName ref="p3671">reginam Danię</persName> hospitia petierunt exilii, si quid <persName ref="p18250">Mauritius</persName> novet.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Ecce <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>iterum proditorem.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Illud miserum: habet <persName ref="p3671">rex Danię</persName> fratrem <persName ref="p20914">ducem Holsteinensem</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>qui in aula Cęsaris meret idque parvo.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Si moreretur rex, quid putas futurum Sic <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>sunt res nostrę, ut si dominus deus noster moreretur, periissemus nos omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in Christo cum tuis et fratribus <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z44"/><persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName>, <persName ref="p8011">Gvalthero</persName>, <persName ref="p8459">Otone</persName> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">(Scribit bonus quidam ac pius in hęc verba: Omnium ora clamant Helvetiis immine[re] exitium, maxime quo<lb xml:id="p1z45"/>d illis inter sese non conveniat.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l569">Wormatia</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>ubi hucusque prędicatorem agit)<note type="margin">a.R.</note></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">T[uus<lb xml:id="p1z47"/>] <persName ref="p8418">Os[valdus] <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Myc[onius]</persName></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro doctissimo, antistiti <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, fratri in domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>perquam venerando suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
